# =============================================================================
# Client private LLM wiki — gitignore
# Blocks: raw drops, private extraction caches, engineering binaries,
#         and credentials. This repo is PROPRIETARY and CONFIDENTIAL.
# =============================================================================

# --- Raw and private extraction directories -----------------------------------
# Raw client project drops never belong in this repo. Curated, redacted
# derivatives go under `sources/` and `pages/` only after a ledger entry.
raw/
private/

# --- Engineering binaries -----------------------------------------------------
# CAD, simulation, and large solver inputs/outputs stay in the local raw-data
# root (/mnt/ace/<CLIENT_RAW_ROOT>/), not in the private wiki.
*.dwg
*.sim

# NOTE: .gitignore CANNOT size-gate files. The plan called for blocking
# `*.dat` files over 10 MB. Since size-based ignore is not expressible in
# `.gitignore` syntax, ALL `*.dat` files are blocked by default below.
# If a small (<10 MB) `.dat` file must be tracked, force-add it explicitly
# with `git add -f path/to/file.dat` after a ledger entry approves it.
*.dat

# --- Credential and secret patterns -------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
*token*
*credential*

# --- OS / editor noise --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
